      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Natural sources include lightning, volcanoes, biological decay, forest fires, soil microorganisms and the oceans. NO is produced when N2 and O2 in the air react during lightning, and it is also produced by microorganisms using the nitrogen of the air."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
